# A save made on a screen of 960x540 loaded on one of 640x480
# (fixtures/narrowload: widesaves's save zed and snapcfg's lba.cfg,
# SaveAnywhere ON). Load Game lists zed, its picture the one widesaves
# showed, and it loads, grown out of its picture.
hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot list
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 0.3
shot zoom
sleep 12
shot loaded
